um all blocks across all levels)\n- **levels**: List of level objects, each containing:\n  - level: number (starting from 1)\n  - coordinates: [base_x, base_y, base_z] (e.g., [0, -60, 0] for flat world level 1)\n  - blocks: Array of {x, z, material} (y is implicit from base_y)\n\n**Critical guidelines:**\n- If example is a house, and request is a church, create a CHURCH blueprint—different proportions, materials, and layout\n- If example uses wood_planks heavily, but request is \"ice palace,\" use ice, packed_ice, blue_concrete—appropriate to the request\n- Match complexity level of example (if 5 levels, create 5 levels; if sparse, keep sparse) but vary content entirely\n- Never copy block positions or material ratios from the example\n\n**Available Materials by Category:**\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Get Materials').item.json) }}\n\nUse this registry as your source of truth. Only use materials from the provided list. \nWhen selecting materials, prioritize variety within categories that match the user request.\nFor example, if building a church, select from [building_blocks, decorative] rather than \nreusing the example's specific block choices."}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","typeVersion":3.1,"position":[-736,928],"id":"67a64169-3126-4b06-8128-9b543abcedec","name":"Blueprint Generator"},{"parameters":{"chatId":"={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.conversationId }}","text":"=Could not find any suitable blueprint to use as template.","additionalFields":{"parse_mode":"HTML"}},"name":"Sample not found","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","typeVersion":1.2,"position":[-1072,1328],"id":"bb46ff08-6346-450b-b070-a4a793b3aefe","webhookId":"fe9e375e-5cfb-436c-8e30-d4651e6268ea","credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"4yys1NU8F0wF3Nr3","name":"Minecraft-Test"}}},{"parameters":{"respondWith":"json","responseBody":"{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Error creating blueprint\"\n}","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","typeVersion":1.5,"position":[-32,1280],"